    "number": 15,
    "summary": "David prepares a place for the ark—The Levites bring the ark to Jerusalem—They sing and minister before the Lord.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And David made him houses in the city of David, and prepared a place for the ark of God, and pitched for it a tent.",
