        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 15:9",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Of the sons of Uzziel; Amminadab the chief, and his brethren an hundred and twelve.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 15:10",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "And David called for Zadok and Abiathar the priests, and for the Levites, for Uriel, Asaiah, and Joel, Shemaiah, and Eliel, and Amminadab,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 15:11",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "And said unto them, Ye are the chief of the fathers of the Levites: sanctify yourselves, both ye and your brethren, that ye may bring up the ark of the Lord God of Israel unto the place that I have prepared for it.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 23,
            "end": 26
          },
          {
            "start": 89,
            "end": 93
          },
          {
            "start": 176,
            "end": 190
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 15:12",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "For because ye did it not at the first, the Lord our God made a breach upon us, for that we sought him not after the due order.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 64,
            "end": 70,
            "text": "1 Chr. 13:11 (10–11)."
          },
          {
            "start": 121,
            "end": 126,
            "text": "D&C 107:84 (84, 99)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 21
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 15:13",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "So the priests and the Levites sanctified themselves to bring up the ark of the Lord God of Israel.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 15:14",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "And the children of the Levites bare the ark of God upon their shoulders with the staves thereon, as Moses commanded according to the word of the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 41,
            "end": 44,
            "text": "Ex. 25:14."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Ex. 25:14.",
            "prettyString": "Exodus 25:14",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "exodus",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 25,
                    "end": 25,
                    "verses": [
                      {
